Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 19:47:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(ui): say "work offset (G54-G59)" plainly and drop the
 stale Setups-page hint

The WCS page said the work offset word is set on the Setups page, directly
above the dropdown that sets it. Replace that with a true line about the
register, and replace "work offset word" / "G-word" in the user-facing
hints and the picker hover with plain wording. The heights page hint now
names the two pages that draw the control (WCS page, Setups page).

Fixes #876
Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 crates/ui/src/egui_app/heights_page.rs   | 18 +++++++++++++++++-
 crates/ui/src/egui_app/pages.rs          |  7 ++++---
 crates/ui/src/egui_app/setup_wcs_pick.rs |  4 ++--
 3 files changed, 23 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

