From 0e8e3603b186478bcf22da2fd7f4906dba131706 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 21:02:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(ui,app): finish the plain "work offset" wording and
 guard the WCS page

- app load note: "G54-G59 is only the word its post writes" -> "only the
  work offset its post uses" (project/wcs_one.rs).
- MCP set_work_offset description and its schema description reworded in
  plain words; the field name `word` and the error text are unchanged.
- WCS page line: "the G54-G59 register" -> "the G54-G59 slot this setup posts".
- New structural guard: the WCS page shows the work-offset dropdown and no
  label on it points at the Setups page (tests/one_wcs.rs). structural::painted
  is now pub(super) so the sibling test can reuse it.

Fixes #876
Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
